DESCRIPTION:
# Arthritis and osteoarthritis models
•	CFA-induced arthritis;
•	Methylated bovine serum albumin (mBSA)-induced arthritis;
•	Monosodium iodoacetate-induced osteoarthritis. 

_Evaluated parameters:_
* Changes in body weight;
* Clinical signs of arthritis (score);
* Edema measurement;
* Thermal and mechanical hyperalgesic threshold;
* Joint microscopic analysis;
* Cell migration (leukocytes);
* Cytokine and other inflammatory mediators release;
* Enzymes/proteins activities and expression.


# Pharmacodynamics
The pharmacodynamic studies are important for evaluating the mechanism of action of a new compound. The development of each compound/product may require a different approach; therefore, CIEnP offers personalized service for experimental trials. We have various techniques, equipment, methods, and approaches available to be associate to different experimental models, in order to meet the needs of custom assays including:

* Colorimetric assay;
* Flow cytometry;
* ELISA; 
* Histology;
* Immunohistochemistry;
* Immunofluorescence; 
* Real-time PCR;
* Western blot;
* Others (on request)

